  "_comment": "Single source for the baked AI mark. AiLabel.module.css and Chip.module.css (variant badge, tone inverse, size fluid) repeat these values; test_stamp.py fails when they disagree. Vspec: docs/drafts/ST-181-ai-image-provenance-compliance-gaps.vspec.html",
